# GDScript architecture

Full briefing: `AGENTS.md`. System details: `_documentation/`.

## Must

- Strict static types on every var, param, return.
- `@onready` casts: `@onready var cam: Camera3D = $Camera3D as Camera3D`
- UI nodes: Scene Unique Names via `%Name`
- Logic ↔ UI only through `SignalBus` (never `get_node` into HUD from combat/world logic)
- Grid steps: Vector math + Tweens + RayCast/GridMap — not CharacterBody3D forces
- Party: 6 slots — front `0..2`, back `3..5` (`DungeonParty`)
- Facings across signals/saves: `"NORTH"|"SOUTH"|"EAST"|"WEST"`
- PNG UI frames: Expand Mode Ignore Size, texture filter Nearest

## Must not

- Untyped GDScript
- New parallel event buses or direct CombatManager→UI calls
- Invent Godot 4.5 APIs — use Context7 `/godotengine/godot-docs` (4.5)
- Guess visual bugs — run game / logs / screenshot
